---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Banner from '../components/Banner.astro';
import nickel from '../assets/photos/nickel-series.jpg';
---

<Base title="Commissions" description="Commissioned crystalline ceramics by Kieran Ryan: colors, sets and pieces made to order." image={nickel}>
  <Banner
    image={nickel}
    focus="50% 55%"
    alt="A crystalline bottle and two cups with blue crystals on a golden ground"
    title="Commissions"
  />

  <section class="section container narrow" aria-label="About commissions">
    <p class="lead">
      If you've seen a glaze you love, or need a set or a gift made to order, I'm happy to talk it
      through. Crystals grow on their own terms, so every commission is a collaboration with the kiln
      as much as with me.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section container narrow" aria-label="How commissions work">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What I can make</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>A piece in a glaze or color from my past work</li>
        <li>Matching sets, like a bottle with cups, or a set of bowls</li>
        <li>Hand-pierced bowls and platters</li>
        <li>Pieces for gifts, weddings and other occasions</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p>
        Get in touch with what you have in mind, and photos of any pieces you like. We agree on the
        form, the glaze, the size and a price. I make and fire the piece, and send you photos before
        it ships.
      </p>
      <p>
        Crystalline firings don't always go to plan. Sometimes a piece takes more than one firing to
        come out right, and no two crystals land the same way twice. I'll send you photos of the
        finished piece so you know exactly what you're getting.
      </p>

      <h2>Timing and price</h2>
      <p class="draft">
        Draft: say how far ahead people should ask, a typical price range, and whether you take a
        deposit.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top: 3rem; text-align: center">
      <a class="button" href="/contact/?piece=A%20commission">Start a commission</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
